    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "B_ev_body",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 492,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 150,
      "text": " 1  192.168.1.1        1.1 ms   1.0 ms   0.9 ms\n 2  isp-gw.net         8.4 ms   8.1 ms   9.0 ms\n 3  10.20.30.1        14.2 ms  13.9 ms  14.5 ms\n 4  * * *   <- packet loss / hop blocking ICMP\n 5  203.0.113.42       41.0 ms  40.5 ms  41.8 ms\n\nRead this for: WHERE latency spikes or packet loss starts",
      "originalText": " 1  192.168.1.1        1.1 ms   1.0 ms   0.9 ms\n 2  isp-gw.net         8.4 ms   8.1 ms   9.0 ms\n 3  10.20.30.1        14.2 ms  13.9 ms  14.5 ms\n 4  * * *   <- packet loss / hop blocking ICMP\n 5  203.0.113.42       41.0 ms  40.5 ms  41.8 ms\n\nRead this for: WHERE latency spikes or packet loss starts",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
