    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "C_left_body",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 872,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "- Run dig from an affected region/device\n- Confirm it resolves to the CURRENT, healthy load-\n  balancer/CDN IP \u2014 not a stale cached or decommissioned one\n- Check the TTL: a very short TTL can cause resolvers to\n  hammer authoritative servers; a very long one delays failover",
      "originalText": "- Run dig from an affected region/device\n- Confirm it resolves to the CURRENT, healthy load-\n  balancer/CDN IP \u2014 not a stale cached or decommissioned one\n- Check the TTL: a very short TTL can cause resolvers to\n  hammer authoritative servers; a very long one delays failover",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
