    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "C_right_body",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 872,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "- Run traceroute from the same affected client/region\n- If latency jumps at one specific hop consistently, that's\n  the culprit \u2014 an ISP peering point or edge router\n- If it fails right at the destination, the problem is the\n  server/load balancer itself, not the network path",
      "originalText": "- Run traceroute from the same affected client/region\n- If latency jumps at one specific hop consistently, that's\n  the culprit \u2014 an ISP peering point or edge router\n- If it fails right at the destination, the problem is the\n  server/load balancer itself, not the network path",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
